			"notes": "## v1.0.1\n\nHotfix for the NeoForge 26.1.x build.\n\n### Fixed\n- Game failing to launch on NeoForge 26.1.2: the Minecraft dependency in `neoforge.mods.toml` was pinned to exactly 26.1 (`versionRange=\"[26.1]\"`), so NeoForge rejected it on 26.1.2. Widened to `[26.1,26.1.2]` so 26.1, 26.1.1 and 26.1.2 are all accepted (runtime-verified on 26.1.1).\n\n### Files\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `bilingualtooltips-26.1.2-1.0.1.jar` | NeoForge 26.1 / 26.1.1 / 26.1.2 |\n\nOther platforms are unchanged from v1.0.0."
