			"notes": "## v1.0.0\n\nInitial release: shows an item's name in a second language in its tooltip (e.g. Chinese and English).\n\n### Features\n- Bilingual item names in tooltips; secondary language auto-picks English on Chinese clients and Chinese otherwise, any language code configurable\n- Cloth Config screen: enable/disable, secondary language, show mode (always / hold Shift), position, only-when-different\n\n### Files\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.1-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.1 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.1-1.0.0.jar` | NeoForge 1.21.1 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.10-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.10 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.11-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.11 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.2-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.2 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.3-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.3 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.4-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.4 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.5-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.5 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.6-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.6 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.7-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.7 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.8-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.8 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-1.21.9-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 1.21.9 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-26.1-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 26.1 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-26.1.1-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 26.1.1 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-26.1.2-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 26.1.2 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-26.1.2-1.0.0.jar` | NeoForge 26.1.2 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-26.2-1.0.0-fabric.jar` | Fabric 26.2 |\n| `bilingualtooltips-26.2-1.0.0.jar` | NeoForge 26.2 |"
